  "goodToKnow": "Der Lehrstuhl is a professorial chair at a university: ein Lehrstuhl für Physik, einen Lehrstuhl innehaben. In the German system, a Lehrstuhl is also a unit with the professor, assistants and secretaries. Getting a Lehrstuhl (a W3 professorship) is the peak of an academic career, often after the Habilitation. Der Lehrstuhlinhaber is the chair holder. Plural: die Lehrstühle."
